126-2671` | `const uint16_t[8704]` (17408 bytes) | Stage-1 index: code point >> 7 -> stage-2 block number. Length = 0x110000/128 = 8704, so it covers the full Unicode range including unassigned planes; many entries repeat the same block number (shared blocks). |\n| `_pcre2_ucd_stage2` | `:2673-5814` | `const uint16_t[40192]` (80384 bytes, **block = 128**) | 314 blocks x 128 entries; each entry is an index into `ucd_records`. Lookup macro `REAL_GET_UCD`/`GET_UCD` `pcre2_internal.h:2126-2132`. |\n\n### pcre2_ucptables_inc.h (included from `pcre2_tables.c:245`)\n| Symbol | Def | Type / length | What varies |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `_pcre2_utt_names` | `pcre2_ucptables_inc.h:576-580` (concatenation of `STRING_*` macros defined earlier in the same file) | `const char[]`, one packed NUL-separated blob; highest offset used is 3828 + strlen (`:1615`), so ~3833 bytes | All property/script names, lower-cased, no spaces/underscores, each NUL-terminated, in the same ascending order as `_pcre2_utt` so that binary search on names works. |\n| `_pcre2_utt` | `:1096-1616` | `const ucp_type_table[519]` | Struct `pcre2_internal.h:2102-2106`: `uint16_t name_offset` (into `utt_names`), `uint16_t type` (`PT_*`), `uint16_t value`. **Sorted by name** (binary search `pcre2_compile.c:2411-2431`). Varies by: `type` — `PT_SC`, `PT_SCX`, `PT_PC`, `PT_GC`, `PT_BOOL`, `PT_ANY` (the `\"any\"` entry at `:1104`, value 0); alias pairs share type+value with different name offsets (e.g. `adlam`/`adlm` both `PT_SCX ucp_Adlam` at `:1097-1098`); some names map to `PT_SC` while their alias maps to `PT_SCX` (e.g. `armi` `PT_SC ucp_Imperial_Aramaic` at `:1109` next to `armn` `PT_SCX ucp_Armenian`). Last two entries are `zyyy -> PT_SC ucp_Common` and `zzzz -> PT_SC ucp_Unknown` (`:1614-1615`). |\n| `_pcre2_utt_size` | `:1617` | `const size_t` = `sizeof(utt)/sizeof(ucp_type_table)` = **519** | Scalar. |\n\nBulk-comparison advice: `_pcre2_OP_lengths` (173 B), `_pcre2_default_tables` (1088 B), `_pcre2_utf8_table4