ference is `{` vs `}` in the last used slot (pcre2_tables.c:84-92)\nC007\t_pcre2_posix_class_maps8\tnone\tread all 42 ints as 14 triples in posix_names order (alpha lower upper alnum ascii blank cntrl digit graph print punct space word xdigit)\tonly alpha and ascii have a non-(-1) second field; only alpha(-2), alnum(2), blank(1) have a non-zero tweak (pcre2_compile.c:645-660)\nC008\t_pcre2_default_tables_8\tnone\tread all TABLES_LENGTH=1088 bytes: lcc 0-255, fcc 256-511, cbits 512-831 (ten 32-byte maps at cbit_space..cbit_cntrl), ctypes 832-1087\tthe four sub-tables at the fixed offsets in pcre2_internal.h:569-598 are the C-locale defaults; every compile that does not call pcre2_set_character_tables reads them (pcre2_chartables.c:24-190)\nC009\t_pcre2_unicode_version_8\tnone\tread the NUL-terminated string\tSUPPORT_UNICODE build returns the real version; the \"Unicode not supported\" alternative is not compiled (pcre2_ucd.c:82)\nC010\t_pcre2_ucd_records_8\tnone\tread all 1563 records field-wise: script, chartype, gbprop, caseset, other_case (signed delta), scriptx_bidiclass (11-bit scriptx + 5-bit bidi class), bprops\trecord 0 is the unassigned fallback; other_case is a delta not an absolute code point (pcre2_ucd.c:554-2124, struct pcre2_internal.h:2110-2118)\nC011\t_pcre2_ucd_stage1_8, _pcre2_ucd_stage2_8\tnone\tread 8704 uint16 and 40192 uint16; additionally drive GET_UCD/UCD_CHARTYPE/UCD_SCRIPT/UCD_GRAPHBREAK/UCD_OTHERCASE/UCD_CASESET for every code point 0..0x10FFFF\ttwo-stage lookup with block size 128: stage1[cp>>7] selects one of 314 stage2 blocks, stage2 entry indexes ucd_records (pcre2_ucd.c:2126-5814, REAL_GET_UCD pcre2_internal.h:2126-2132)\nC012\t_pcre2_ucd_caseless_sets_8, _pcre2_ucd_turkish_dotted_i_caseset_8\tnone\tread all 118 uint32 (NOTACHAR-separated runs, index 0 is a lone sentinel); read the scalar (=112) and both sets at 112 and 112+3\tcaseset offset 0 means \"no set\"; the Turkish dotted/dotless-I sets are addressed by the scalar and are used by PCRE2_EXTRA_TURKISH_CASING (pcre2_ucd.c:117-154, pcre2_compile.c:6383,8427)\nC013\t_pcre2_ucd_digit_sets_8\tnone\tread 78 uint32; [0]=77 is the count, [1]=0x39 is the ASCII fast-path value\t_pcre2_script_run uses [1] as a fast path then binary-chops [2..77] (pcre2_ucd.c:216-228, pcre2_script_run.c:306-320)\nC014\t_pcre2_ucd_script_sets_8\tnone\tread all 476 uint32 = 119 bitsets of 4 words; row 0 must be all zero\tscript-extension bitmaps addressed by UCD_SCRIPTX_PROP (mask 0x3ff) (pcre2_ucd.c:234-354, pcre2_internal.h:2134)\nC015\t_pcre2_ucd_boolprop_sets_8\tnone\tread all 382 uint32 = 191 bitsets of 2 words; row 0 must be all zero\tboolean-property bitmaps addressed by UCD_BPROPS_PROP (mask 0xfff) (pcre2_ucd.c:360-552, pcre2_internal.h:2136)\nC016\t_pcre2_ucd_nocase_ranges_8, _pcre2_ucd_nocase_ranges_size_8\tnone\tread 84 uint32 (42 exclusive lo/hi pairs, last is the 0xffffffff sentinel) and the scalar 82\tthe size excludes the sentinel; the binary search in compile_class relies on ascending exclusive bounds (pcre2_ucd.c:164-210, pcre2_compile_class.c:128-146)\nC017\t_pcre2_utt_8, _pcre2_utt_names_8, _pcre2_utt_size_8\tnone\tread all 519 ucp_type_table entries {name_offset, type, value} and dereference each name_offset into the names blob; check the table is sorted by name\tthe compile-time \\p{...} lookup is a binary search over names; alias pairs share type+value, and some name/alias pairs differ in PT_SC vs PT_SCX (pcre2_ucptables_inc.h:1096-1617, lookup pcre2_compile.c:2411-2431)\nC018\t_pcre2_default_compile_context_8, _pcre2_default_match_context_8, _pcre2_default_convert_context_8\tnone; read the statics before any setter runs\tread every field of the three exported context statics\tthese are the values used when NULL contexts are passed: tables=_pcre2_default_tables, max_pattern_length/max_pattern_compiled_length=PCRE2_UNSET, BSR_DEFAULT=PCRE2_BSR_UNICODE, NEWLINE_DEFAULT=2 (LF), PARENS_NEST_LIMIT=250, MAX_VARLOOKBEHIND=255, PCRE2_OPTIMIZATION_ALL; offse